								<div class="media-body process_action_1">
									<h4>Performance</h4>
									<p>"Past performance is not a measure of the future outcome". While every investor must bear this disclaimer in mind, this does become an important yardstick to see how the funds have performed in the past vs. its benchmark. Consistency, along with stability of returns is what we believe is a crucial mix in selecting investment portfolios.</p>
									<p>Periodic rebalancing of positions mitigates costly emotional mistakes and helps you buy low, sell high, and always remain well-diversified. Intrinsic research has proven that regular rebalancing of your investment portfolio can significantly enhance its value over time. It is for this reason alone, that we insist on regular, quarterly meetings with you to sit and discuss the performance and recommend changes, if any, to your investments with us.</p>
